    "Manager runtime currently24555 bytes,21 bytes below EIP170; future edits require size review.",
    "Price tracks OMR turnover, not USD price; actual wash trades can influence following day bounded quote while paying trading fees.",
    "Ordinary stock token issuers retain any seizure/upgrade/rebase/transfer restriction powers. Existing generic token-bound accounts require separate checked asset migration.",
